# {{senseid|en|Q181741}}{{lb|en|astrophysics}} The [[gravitational]] [[sphere]] of a [[black hole]] within which the [[escape velocity]] is greater than the [[speed of light]].
# {{lb|en|astrophysics}} The furthest distance in the past of the [[universe]] from which light signals from an event can reach an observer at later times. 
# {{lb|en|figuratively|by extension}} A [[point of no return]].

