#: {{ux|en|The neural network was trained over 500 '''epochs'''.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2021|author=Joe Papa|title=PyTorch Pocket Reference|publisher=O'Reilly Media|isbn=9781492089957|text=For now, let's test and evaluate our GAN by comparing the results from the first '''epoch''' with the generated images from the last '''epoch'''.}}

