#* {{RQ:Fielding Tom Jones|passage=it dives into the heart of the observed, and there espies evil, as it were, in the first '''embryo''' {{...}}}}
#* {{RQ:Trollope Framley Parsonage|passage=Lord Lufton, with his barony and twenty thousand a year, might be accepted as just good enough; but failing him there was an '''embryo''' marquis, whose fortune would be more than ten times as great, all ready to accept his child!}}

